{"archive": {"commit": "8012191c69c75a008356ba7b7bd422f0d57d2884", "object_pointer": "/53", "path": "reports/pnt-history/issues-page-2.json", "sha256": "2b4990cac121720f1b2489f96eac49d858e01979ceb72458191dccae5e646f7f"}, "association_note": "The upstream report identifies the named definition/theorem or its blueprint. Links include collected before/after versions; a report about a blueprint is not treated as an allegation against unchanged Formal.", "dataset": "pnt", "excerpts": [{"field": "/body", "text": "## Summary\n- Classical zero-free region: $\\Re(s)\\ge 1-1/(R\\log|t|)$, matching Lean.\n- Riemann–von Mangoldt: restore the absolute value around the main term.\n- Zero-density bound: drop the pasted RvM fragment; state the $N(\\sigma,T)$ estimate.\n\n## Test plan\n- [ ] Diff blueprints against the Lean defs in `ZetaDefinitions.lean`"}], "id": "pr-1648", "origin": "upstream_repository", "projects": [{"input_sha256": "b0549b3de0991a4648f4342e85fba2b203fe8b9885baaa294151cd860a5fb2bc", "project_id": "classical-zero-free-text-before", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "riemannZeta.classicalZeroFree", "source_commit": "e32cf2d56926389a22109fcc92cc6c2af889161a", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}, {"input_sha256": "4137382a35c4f4d0cbeff3d04984d4015d5edbb8be87a154d1a764d16dbff8b3", "project_id": "classical-zero-free-text-after", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "riemannZeta.classicalZeroFree", "source_commit": "e32cf2d56926389a22109fcc92cc6c2af889161a", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}, {"input_sha256": "dab5eecee3e9e3b3893c95a2c0c12ca486b8e6f46dc17978fca4aefd673b8877", "project_id": "riemann-von-mangoldt-text-before", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "riemannZeta.Riemann_vonMangoldt_bound", "source_commit": "e32cf2d56926389a22109fcc92cc6c2af889161a", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}, {"input_sha256": "cd7383940e6ee321108205881dbdee3d645fa941420f5e7972a77ac031e8786e", "project_id": "riemann-von-mangoldt-text-after", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "riemannZeta.Riemann_vonMangoldt_bound", "source_commit": "e32cf2d56926389a22109fcc92cc6c2af889161a", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}, {"input_sha256": "de08bdd08260ab1bed68f7f2da5946700be28d086c62751909b9cb794cd35712", "project_id": "zero-density-text-before", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "zero_density_bound", "source_commit": "e32cf2d56926389a22109fcc92cc6c2af889161a", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}, {"input_sha256": "781a5cda388b6f871e21275a920003f5e8a0805f4aab83a3e961472310be5e2a", "project_id": "zero-density-text-after", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "zero_density_bound", "source_commit": "e32cf2d56926389a22109fcc92cc6c2af889161a", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}], "schema_version": "paperlean-upstream-evidence-1", "source": {"author": "chessing234", "kind": "pr", "repository": "https://github.com/AlexKontorovich/PrimeNumberTheoremAnd", "title": "fix: classical ZFR, RvM, and ZDB blueprint statements", "url": "https://github.com/AlexKontorovich/PrimeNumberTheoremAnd/pull/1648"}, "truth_status": "unverified_upstream_claim", "usable_as_scoring_label": false}
{"archive": {"commit": "8012191c69c75a008356ba7b7bd422f0d57d2884", "object_pointer": "/43", "path": "reports/pnt-history/issues-page-2.json", "sha256": "2b4990cac121720f1b2489f96eac49d858e01979ceb72458191dccae5e646f7f"}, "association_note": "The upstream report identifies the named definition/theorem or its blueprint. Links include collected before/after versions; a report about a blueprint is not treated as an allegation against unchanged Formal.", "dataset": "pnt", "excerpts": [{"field": "/body", "text": "## Summary\n- Replace the $\\Lambda(n)/n$ sum with Büthe’s $\\pi^*(x)=\\sum_k\\pi(x^{1/k})/k$.\n- Aligns `Eπ_star` with the intended comparison function.\n\n## Test plan\n- [ ] Check arXiv:1511.02032 (1.4) and `Buthe.pi_star`"}], "id": "pr-1658", "origin": "upstream_repository", "projects": [{"input_sha256": "022a26b94e3693432178be5c51ec33485038d163b8dd8294971cf5d48be4c9a4", "project_id": "pi-star-before", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "pi_star", "source_commit": "657ac0e5cf42c45b03b93a662fd8237b6b0be49f", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}, {"input_sha256": "ba8531bb0b37e077873e6c86b65d9fffdc3d8f5e84d54de9b67861b01b4370c3", "project_id": "pi-star-after", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "pi_star", "source_commit": "e32cf2d56926389a22109fcc92cc6c2af889161a", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}], "schema_version": "paperlean-upstream-evidence-1", "source": {"author": "chessing234", "kind": "pr", "repository": "https://github.com/AlexKontorovich/PrimeNumberTheoremAnd", "title": "fix: π* is ∑ π(x^{1/k})/k", "url": "https://github.com/AlexKontorovich/PrimeNumberTheoremAnd/pull/1658"}, "truth_status": "unverified_upstream_claim", "usable_as_scoring_label": false}
{"archive": {"commit": "8012191c69c75a008356ba7b7bd422f0d57d2884", "object_pointer": "/75", "path": "reports/pnt-history/issues-page-2.json", "sha256": "2b4990cac121720f1b2489f96eac49d858e01979ceb72458191dccae5e646f7f"}, "association_note": "The upstream report identifies the named definition/theorem or its blueprint. Links include collected before/after versions; a report about a blueprint is not treated as an allegation against unchanged Formal.", "dataset": "pnt", "excerpts": [{"field": "/body", "text": "## Summary\n- `LSeries_totient_eq` only assumed `1 < Re(s)`, but the totient Dirichlet series converges absolutely only for `Re(s) > 2`.\n\n## Root cause\nIn the strip `1 < Re(s) ≤ 2` the L-series need not converge absolutely, so the Euler product identity is false as stated.\n\n## Fix\nStrengthen the hypothesis to `2 < s.re`, matching IK (1.35).\n\n## Test plan\n- [ ] `lake build PrimeNumberTheoremAnd.IwaniecKowalskiCh1`\n\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)"}], "id": "pr-1626", "origin": "upstream_repository", "projects": [{"input_sha256": "3513c9caabc4ff346d9ad0f83f51eaba71a67c51b2620488837dd3c91edec416", "project_id": "ik-totient-before", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "ArithmeticFunction.LSeries_totient_eq", "source_commit": "99d4ce46962a09b4ed95574e95c62b491673a1ad", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}, {"input_sha256": "502db45dcc8ec2b9f954e26fec79ca9185a1c2b5fd58afc8b85ae08d451959b8", "project_id": "ik-totient-after", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "ArithmeticFunction.LSeries_totient_eq", "source_commit": "657ac0e5cf42c45b03b93a662fd8237b6b0be49f", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}], "schema_version": "paperlean-upstream-evidence-1", "source": {"author": "chessing234", "kind": "pr", "repository": "https://github.com/AlexKontorovich/PrimeNumberTheoremAnd", "title": "fix: require Re(s) > 2 in LSeries_totient_eq", "url": "https://github.com/AlexKontorovich/PrimeNumberTheoremAnd/pull/1626"}, "truth_status": "unverified_upstream_claim", "usable_as_scoring_label": false}
{"archive": {"commit": "8012191c69c75a008356ba7b7bd422f0d57d2884", "object_pointer": "/69", "path": "reports/pnt-history/issues-page-2.json", "sha256": "2b4990cac121720f1b2489f96eac49d858e01979ceb72458191dccae5e646f7f"}, "association_note": "The upstream report identifies the named definition/theorem or its blueprint. Links include collected before/after versions; a report about a blueprint is not treated as an allegation against unchanged Formal.", "dataset": "pnt", "excerpts": [{"field": "/body", "text": "## Summary\n- `LSeries_liouville_eq` now uses `↗liouville`, matching `↗τ`, `↗totient`, etc.\n- `zeta_pow_two` blueprint states `Re(s) > 1`, consistent with the Lean hypothesis.\n\n## Test plan\n- [ ] `lake build PrimeNumberTheoremAnd/IwaniecKowalskiCh1.lean`\n\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)"}], "id": "pr-1632", "origin": "upstream_repository", "projects": [{"input_sha256": "3af95d1d845257125a7a62ee71b796ab61dc8d885bd35bd31ef8faa5a6200c5d", "project_id": "ik-liouville-before", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "ArithmeticFunction.LSeries_liouville_eq", "source_commit": "99d4ce46962a09b4ed95574e95c62b491673a1ad", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}, {"input_sha256": "eb64b0e75cb90c84c5e15c900f8656d8d0809364a4528cac8688ceadbcd905ed", "project_id": "ik-liouville-after", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "ArithmeticFunction.LSeries_liouville_eq", "source_commit": "657ac0e5cf42c45b03b93a662fd8237b6b0be49f", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}], "schema_version": "paperlean-upstream-evidence-1", "source": {"author": "chessing234", "kind": "pr", "repository": "https://github.com/AlexKontorovich/PrimeNumberTheoremAnd", "title": "fix: ↗liouville in LSeries_liouville_eq and Re(s) > 1 in zeta_pow_two blueprint", "url": "https://github.com/AlexKontorovich/PrimeNumberTheoremAnd/pull/1632"}, "truth_status": "unverified_upstream_claim", "usable_as_scoring_label": false}
{"archive": {"commit": "8012191c69c75a008356ba7b7bd422f0d57d2884", "object_pointer": "/41", "path": "reports/pnt-history/issues-page-2.json", "sha256": "2b4990cac121720f1b2489f96eac49d858e01979ceb72458191dccae5e646f7f"}, "association_note": "The upstream report identifies the named definition/theorem or its blueprint. Links include collected before/after versions; a report about a blueprint is not treated as an allegation against unchanged Formal.", "dataset": "pnt", "excerpts": [{"field": "/body", "text": "## Summary\n- Blueprint proof had $(1-p^{-s})^{-1}(1-p^{-2s})$; needs $(1-p^{-s})(1-p^{-2s})^{-1}$.\n\n## Test plan\n- [ ] Check against $\\zeta(2s)/\\zeta(s)=\\prod(1+p^{-s})^{-1}$"}], "id": "pr-1660", "origin": "upstream_repository", "projects": [{"input_sha256": "3af95d1d845257125a7a62ee71b796ab61dc8d885bd35bd31ef8faa5a6200c5d", "project_id": "ik-liouville-before", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "ArithmeticFunction.LSeries_liouville_eq", "source_commit": "99d4ce46962a09b4ed95574e95c62b491673a1ad", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}, {"input_sha256": "eb64b0e75cb90c84c5e15c900f8656d8d0809364a4528cac8688ceadbcd905ed", "project_id": "ik-liouville-after", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "ArithmeticFunction.LSeries_liouville_eq", "source_commit": "657ac0e5cf42c45b03b93a662fd8237b6b0be49f", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}], "schema_version": "paperlean-upstream-evidence-1", "source": {"author": "chessing234", "kind": "pr", "repository": "https://github.com/AlexKontorovich/PrimeNumberTheoremAnd", "title": "fix: Liouville Euler product factors", "url": "https://github.com/AlexKontorovich/PrimeNumberTheoremAnd/pull/1660"}, "truth_status": "unverified_upstream_claim", "usable_as_scoring_label": false}
{"archive": {"commit": "8012191c69c75a008356ba7b7bd422f0d57d2884", "object_pointer": "/31", "path": "reports/pnt-history/issues-page-2.json", "sha256": "2b4990cac121720f1b2489f96eac49d858e01979ceb72458191dccae5e646f7f"}, "association_note": "The upstream report identifies the named definition/theorem or its blueprint. Links include collected before/after versions; a report about a blueprint is not treated as an allegation against unchanged Formal.", "dataset": "pnt", "excerpts": [{"field": "/body", "text": "## Summary\n- Prop 3.2 relative `|ψ-x|/x`\n- Prop 4.3 paper lower bounds\n- Cor 5.5 gap length `x/(5000\\log^2 x)`\n- Thm 5.7 includes `-B₃`\n\nSupersedes #1643 #1645 #1649 #1651.\n\n## Test plan\n- [ ] Compare Dusart 2018 statements\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)"}], "id": "pr-1670", "origin": "upstream_repository", "projects": [{"input_sha256": "fe4f774e3b712152c073d6587da4e5fbeb7ebb617a9972b3a4881290c9328ac5", "project_id": "bounded-dusart-table-error-text-before", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "Dusart.proposition_3_2", "source_commit": "57b0698f119db17fae2ee01a4e56651a9b96ea5c", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}, {"input_sha256": "183d7a73767d204609e63a6b9e1bc63f46eae92793278c281cef2a31fe6a5321", "project_id": "bounded-dusart-table-error-text-after", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "Dusart.proposition_3_2", "source_commit": "57b0698f119db17fae2ee01a4e56651a9b96ea5c", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}, {"input_sha256": "71e7696a702b6be070310064c96471a728a490df3857c156019a35f3d96c331f", "project_id": "bounded-dusart-psi-theta", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "Dusart.proposition_4_3", "source_commit": "57b0698f119db17fae2ee01a4e56651a9b96ea5c", "statement_applicability": "not_adjudicated"}, {"input_sha256": "15c044d4f945b5728515aa53e61a02bc02d49a619517638b6dd136833bb3db56", "project_id": "bounded-dusart-prime-interval", "relationship": "reported_subject", "root": "Dusart.corollary_5_5", "s